:"斩瀑","type":"单手剑","variants":[{"id":9010724,"code":"cwp_alicia_epic","label":"普通","stars":5,"sprite":{"sheet":"items","name":"cwp_alicia"},"stats":[{"name":"每秒伤害","values":[605,664],"baseValues":[604.6560000000001,663.9360000000001],"grows":true},{"name":"虚属性攻击","values":[194,213],"baseValues":[193.8,212.8],"grows":true},{"name":"暴击率","values":[4,4],"unit":"%"}],"growthRate":1.02,"mainOptions":[{"name":"技能伤害值","min":4.0,"max":18.0,"unit":"%"},{"name":"生命","min":4.0,"max":12.0,"unit":"%"},{"name":"防御","min":4.0,"max":10.0,"unit":"%"}],"subOptions":[{"name":"武器技能恢复速度","min":3.0,"max":10.0,"unit":"%"}],"subCount":[0,1],"limitBreak":[{"name":"攻击","min":10.0,"max":10.0,"unit":"%"}],"engrave":[{"name":"攻击","min":15.0,"max":15.0,"unit":"%"},{"name":"生命","min":15.0,"max":15.0,"unit":"%"}],"engraveRandom":[{"name":"攻击","unit":"%","values":[3.0,6.0,9.0,12.0,15.0]}],"effects":[{"name":"专属效果","description":"命中时，每2秒造成一次相当于每秒伤害40%的持续伤害。\n秘剑・连击 蜉蝣的威力提升至100%，并使敌人的虚属性抵抗减少30%，持续7秒。"}],"skill":{"name":"流水斩","description":"与剑一同旋转，对敌人造成近程伤害，并使其陷入重伤状态。","levels":[1,5],"damage":[180.0,260.0],"cooldown":[9.0,7.0],"ailment":"重伤"}},{"id":9010725,"code":"cwp_alicia_myth","label":"开花","stars":6,"sprite":{"sheet":"items","name":"cwp_alicia"},"stats":[{"name":"每秒伤害","values":[751,825],"baseValues":[750.982752,824.608512],"grows":true},{"name":"虚属性攻击","values":[241,264],"baseValues":[240.6996,264.2976],"grows":true},{"name":"暴击率","values":[4,4],"unit":"%"}],"growthRate":1.02,"mainOptions":[{"name":"技能伤害值","min":4.0,"max":18.0,"unit":"%"},{"name":"生命","min":4.0,"max":12.0,"unit":"%"},{"name":"防御","min":4.0,"max":10.0,"unit":"%"}],"subOptions":[{"name":"武器技能恢复速度","min":3.0,"max":10.0,"unit":"%"}],"subCount":[0,1],"limitBreak":[{"name":"攻击","min":15.0,"max":15.0,"unit":"%"}],"engrave":[{"name":"攻击","min":15.0,"max":15.0,"unit":"%"},{"name":"生命","min":15.0,"max":15.0,"unit":"%"}],"engraveRandom":[{"name":"攻击","unit":"%","values":[3.0,6.0,9.0,12.0,15.0]}],"effects":[{"name":"专属效果","description":"命中时，每2秒造成一次相当于每秒伤害60%的持续伤害。\n秘剑・连击 蜉蝣的威力提升至100%，并使敌人的虚属性抵抗减少30%，持续7秒。"}],"skill":{"name":"流水斩","description":"与剑一同旋转，对敌人造成近程伤害，并使其陷入重伤状态。","levels":[1,5],"damage":[270.0,270.0],"cooldown":[9.0,7.0],"ailment":"重伤"}}],"number":1}],"profile":{"Age":null,"Height":null,"Weight":null},"tribes":["人族"],"story":"阿莉西亚是被注入魔兽王之魔血而复活、操纵「至宝」的勇者。\n\n出身于索格村的勇者阿莉西亚，在天才剑士的父亲教导下成长，梦想着成为真正的勇者。讨伐阻塞世界尽头的魔兽王、让世界延展得更广阔——那便是她的目标。凭借不懈的努力，她成为十三名勇者之一，被亥登王赐予“至宝”，踏上了讨伐魔兽王的旅途。然而，她终究不是魔兽王克雷瓦提斯的对手，只在其角上留下浅浅一道伤痕便战败身亡。\n\n阿莉西亚死去不久，便被杀死她的仇敌魔兽王克雷瓦提斯复活。在她身亡的那个那晚，派遣她的亥登王国也已被魔兽王毁灭。而更不幸的是，她的体内被注入了克雷瓦提斯的血液。\n\n为了讨伐魔兽王而成为勇者的自己，如今却成了魔兽王的仆人。面对这样的现实，阿莉西亚陷入了绝望。然而不幸中的万幸是，此刻的魔兽王却突然专心于照料一名婴儿。看到对王族血脉的新生儿“卢纳”表现出兴趣的克雷瓦提斯，阿莉西亚隐约感觉到卢纳的生死正掌握着这个世界的命运。无论如何，她必须阻止魔兽王在摧毁亥登王国之后，将整个世界一并毁灭。\n\n为了拯救人族的世界，阿莉西亚至今仍以她自己的方式战斗着。即便她的身体已是一具尸骸，但依旧是一名勇者。","storyKey":"profile_alicia_story","sources":{"hero":"heroes.json / OriginId=686","profile":"heroprofile.json / OriginId=686","strings":"strings-zhCN.json","items":"items.json / TargetCharacterIds, ExclusiveCharacterId","voiceLines":["strings-zhCN.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-enUS.json / Voice_*, cv_*","strings-jaJP.json / Voice_*, cv_*"]},"voiceLines":[{"id":"alicia","label":"普通","lines":[{"type":"NormalBattleWin","label":"胜利-普通战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["我可没那么容易被干掉啊。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_NormalBattleWin"]},{"type":"BossBattleWin","label":"胜利-首领战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["总算还是保护了大家。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_BossBattleWin"]},{"type":"Die","label":"阵亡","texts":{"zhCN":["真是惨不忍睹。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_Die"]},{"type":"GetExp","label":"获得经验结晶","texts":{"zhCN":["哦，感觉浑身充满了力量。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_GetExp"]},{"type":"LevelUp","label":"升级","texts":{"zhCN":["就算死了也不会放弃变强。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_LevelUp"]},{"type":"EquipWeapon","label":"佩戴装备","texts":{"zhCN":["剑身匀称又很轻巧，虽然不是亥登的魔剑，但也是把好剑。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_EquipWeapon"]},{"type":"EquipCostume","label":"穿戴时装","texts":{"zhCN":["这、这要穿这种东西吗！？"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_EquipCostume"]},{"type":"Evolve","label":"进化","texts":{"zhCN":["我会变得更强，看着吧，爸爸。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_Evolve"]},{"type":"Attack1","label":"攻击1","texts":{"zhCN":["哈！"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_Attack1"]},{"type":"Attack2","label":"攻击2","texts":{"zhCN":["哈啊啊！"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_Attack2"]},{"type":"Attack3","label":"攻击3","texts":{"zhCN":["咿呀！"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_Attack3"]},{"type":"Skill1","label":"技能1","texts":{"zhCN":["这招如何，你这怪物！"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_Skill1"]},{"type":"Skill2","label":"技能2","texts":{"zhCN":["休想得逞。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_Skill2"]},{"type":"Damaged1","label":"受到攻击1","texts":{"zhCN":["咳呃！"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_Damaged1"]},{"type":"Damaged2","label":"受到攻击2","texts":{"zhCN":["啊！"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_Damaged2"]},{"type":"PlayerChooseBright","label":"人物友善值选项","texts":{"zhCN":["这不是挺棒的吗，原来也有好的一面啊。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_PlayerChooseBright"]},{"type":"PlayerChooseDark","label":"人物邪恶值选项","texts":{"zhCN":["这么做可成不了优秀勇者的。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_PlayerChooseDark"]},{"type":"WeakEnemyBattleStart","label":"与弱小敌人战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["不就是灭一帮山贼吗，我做就是了。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_WeakEnemyBattleStart"]},{"type":"NormalEnemyBattleStart","label":"与普通敌人战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["可怜的究竟是我，还是这帮人呢。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_NormalEnemyBattleStart"]},{"type":"StrongEnemyBattleStart","label":"与强大敌人战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["这家伙很强。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_StrongEnemyBattleStart"]},{"type":"BossBattleStart","label":"与首领战斗","texts":{"zhCN":["以勇者的荣耀起誓，我一定会将其击倒。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_BossBattleStart"]},{"type":"JoinParty","label":"首次加入队伍","texts":{"zhCN":["如果你能和我一同阻止人类灭亡，我会很感激。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_JoinParty"]},{"type":"CoopAttack","label":"战斗-攻击","texts":{"zhCN":["就是现在！"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_CoopAttack"]},{"type":"CoopHeal","label":"战斗-请求治疗","texts":{"zhCN":["能帮我治疗一下吗，最好是在我死之前…"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_CoopHeal"]},{"type":"CoopRun","label":"战斗-注意","texts":{"zhCN":["先跑吧。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_CoopRun"]},{"type":"CoopWin","label":"战斗-胜利","texts":{"zhCN":["我是不是又做了件勇者该做的事？"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_CoopWin"]},{"type":"CoopMVP","label":"战斗-最佳队员","texts":{"zhCN":["其实我还是第一次用剑赢得了别人的笑容，而且终于做了件像是勇者该做的事，我很高兴之类的，别逼我说得这么清楚啊，可恶…"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_CoopMVP"]},{"type":"CoopHi","label":"战斗-问候","texts":{"zhCN":["我…我叫阿莉西亚…索格村的阿莉西亚…"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_CoopHi"]},{"type":"CoopHurryUp","label":"战斗-急迫","texts":{"zhCN":["跑起来！"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_CoopHurryUp"]},{"type":"CoopBelieve","label":"战斗-信任","texts":{"zhCN":["这里交给我处理吧。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_CoopBelieve"]},{"type":"TouchReactionGood1","label":"触碰反应-积极1","texts":{"zhCN":["不要紧，我可是勇者，为值得守护之人的未来与希望奉献生命，就是我的职责。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["Voice_alicia_1_TouchReactionGood1","cv_alicia_TouchReactionGood1"]},{"type":"TouchReactionGood2","label":"触碰反应-积极2","texts":{"zhCN":["仿造的又如何，当不成真正的勇者也无妨，即便如此，我也是勇者。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["Voice_alicia_1_TouchReactionGood2","cv_alicia_TouchReactionGood2"]},{"type":"TouchReactionBad1","label":"触碰反应-消极1","texts":{"zhCN":["能恢复行动是很好，可这份痛感真的无法消除呢。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["Voice_alicia_1_TouchReactionBad1","cv_alicia_TouchReactionBad1"]},{"type":"TouchReactionBad2","label":"触碰反应-消极2","texts":{"zhCN":["把我和粪便相提并论吗，真是悲惨啊。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["Voice_alicia_1_TouchReactionBad2","cv_alicia_TouchReactionBad2"]},{"type":"NoticeMail","label":"邮件提示","texts":{"zhCN":["是信吗？究竟是谁。"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["Voice_alicia_1_NoticeMail","cv_alicia_NoticeMail"]},{"type":"NoticeEvent","label":"活动提示","texts":{"zhCN":["庆典？好奇的话，要去看看吗？"],"enUS":[],"jaJP":[]},"keys":["cv_alicia_NoticeEvent"]},{"type":"SummonSpeech1",